<title>USA: Warrantech Corp Q3 diluted shr rises. [CORRECTED 23:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>Warrantech Corp Q3 diluted shr rises. [CORRECTED 23:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(millions of dollars)</p>
<p>			  For the three months  For the nine months</p>
<p>			     ended December 31,  ended December 31,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Gross revenues	 $ 42.1     $ 34.8     $116.8	$78.8</p>
<p> Net income		  1.8	  1.6	  5.3	  2.9</p>
<p>Net income per share:</p>
<p>  Primary		   0.12	 0.10	 0.35	 0.18</p>
<p>  Fully diluted	   0.12	 0.09	 0.34	 0.17</p>
<p>Avg shrs:</p>
<p>  Primary	   15,587,366 15,770,697 15,085,776 15,724,944</p>
<p>  Fully diluted   15,606,166 16,943,919 15,528,601 16,941,129</p>
<p>(Corrects from 16,606,166 the fully diluted shares for the 3 months ended 1996.)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 periods included after tax gains of approximately $1.8 million or $0.11 per share in the nine month and $1.0 million or $0.06 per share third quarter periods.</p>
<p>1996 nine month period includes an after tax gain of $1,147,199 or $0.08 per share from the sale of an joint venture stake gain related to the company's sale of its international joint venture investment to its partner American International Group Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
